<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6249" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβῐ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβιοῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					832b6
				</span></i>
			 (but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβιώσκομαι</span> (q. v.)
			is the common pres.): aor. 2
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεβίων</span> (v. infr.), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεβίουν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
					40
				</span></i>
			; later aor. 1
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεβίωσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					587a24
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.14.12
			</span></i>: also aor.
			
				Med.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβιώσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					12.50
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβεβίωκα</span> E.ap. Phot.<i><span class="en">
				p.107
			</span></i> R., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
			</span></i>&lt;*&gt;:—<i>come to life again,</i>
			&lt;*&gt; <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				177
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπειδὴ ἀνεβιω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					1.125
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβιοὺς ἐλεγεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					614b
				</span></i>
			:— also 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβιοῦσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.377b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
